		<!-- faq-section - start
		================================================== -->
		<section id="faq-section" class="faq-section sec-ptb-100 clearfix">
			<div class="container">

				<!-- ── Section 1: Account ── -->
				<div class="section-title mb-50">
					<div class="row">
						<div class="col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12">
							<h2 class="big-title">1. about <strong>your account</strong></h2>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="faq-content-wrapper mb-80">
					<div class="row">

						<!-- left column -->
						<div class="col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12">
							<div id="faq-accordion" class="faq-accordion">

								<div class="card">
									<div class="card-header" id="headingone">
										<button class="btn collapsed" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#collapseone" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseone">
											<span>01.</span> How do I register on Harmoni?
										</button>
									</div>
									<div id="collapseone" class="collapse" aria-labelledby="headingone" data-parent="#faq-accordion">
										<div class="card-body">
											Click the Register button on the homepage and choose your role — Workhand or Company. Fill in your basic details, verify your email, and your account will be ready to use immediately.
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>

								<div class="card">
									<div class="card-header" id="headingtwo">
										<button class="btn" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#collapsetwo" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="collapsetwo">
											<span>02.</span> What is the difference between Workhand and Company?
										</button>
									</div>
									<div id="collapsetwo" class="collapse show" aria-labelledby="headingtwo" data-parent="#faq-accordion">
										<div class="card-body">
											A Workhand is an event professional who browses and applies for event staffing roles. A Company is an event organiser that posts events, sets role requirements, reviews applicants, and manages payments. Each account type has its own dashboard and features.
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>

								<div class="card">
									<div class="card-header" id="headingthree">
										<button class="btn collapsed" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#collapsethree" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapsethree">
											<span>03.</span> Can I change my role after registering?
										</button>
									</div>
									<div id="collapsethree" class="collapse" aria-labelledby="headingthree" data-parent="#faq-accordion">
										<div class="card-body">
											Roles are assigned at registration and are tied to your account type. If you need a different role, you would need to register a separate account with the appropriate role selected.
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>

								<div class="card">
									<div class="card-header" id="headingfour">
										<button class="btn collapsed" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#collapsefour" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapsefour">
											<span>04.</span> How do I update my profile information?
										</button>
									</div>
									<div id="collapsefour" class="collapse" aria-labelledby="headingfour" data-parent="#faq-accordion">
										<div class="card-body">
											Log in to your account and go to your profile settings. You can update your name, contact details, skills, and profile photo at any time. Changes are saved immediately.
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>

							</div>
						</div>
						<!-- left column end -->

						<!-- right column -->
						<div class="col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12">
							<div id="faq-accordion2" class="faq-accordion">

								<div class="card">
									<div class="card-header" id="headingfive">
										<button class="btn collapsed" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#collapsfive" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapsfive">
											<span>05.</span> Is my personal information kept private?
										</button>
									</div>
									<div id="collapsfive" class="collapse" aria-labelledby="headingfive" data-parent="#faq-accordion2">
										<div class="card-body">
											Yes. Your personal information is only shared with companies or workhands when you enter an active event engagement. We do not sell or share your data with third parties outside the platform.
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>

								<div class="card">
									<div class="card-header" id="headingsix">
										<button class="btn" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#collapsesix" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="collapsesix">
											<span>06.</span> What should I do if I forget my password?
										</button>
									</div>
									<div id="collapsesix" class="collapse show" aria-labelledby="headingsix" data-parent="#faq-accordion2">
										<div class="card-body">
											On the login page, click Forgot Password and enter your registered email address. You will receive a reset link within a few minutes. Follow the link to set a new password for your account.
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>

								<div class="card">
									<div class="card-header" id="headingseven">
										<button class="btn collapsed" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#collapseseven" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseseven">
											<span>07.</span> Can one person have both a Workhand and Company account?
										</button>
									</div>
									<div id="collapseseven" class="collapse" aria-labelledby="headingseven" data-parent="#faq-accordion2">
										<div class="card-body">
											Each email address is tied to a single role on Harmoni. If you need both, you can register two separate accounts using different email addresses one as a Workhand and one as a Company.
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>

								<div class="card">
									<div class="card-header" id="headingeight">
										<button class="btn collapsed" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#collapseeight" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseeight">
											<span>08.</span> How do I contact Harmoni support?
										</button>
									</div>
									<div id="collapseeight" class="collapse" aria-labelledby="headingeight" data-parent="#faq-accordion2">
										<div class="card-body">
											You can reach our support team through the Contact page on the website. Fill in your name, email, and message and we will get back to you as soon as possible.
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>

							</div>
						</div>
						<!-- right column end -->

					</div>
				</div>
				<!-- Section 1 end -->


				<!-- ── Section 2: Events ── -->
				<div class="section-title mb-50">
					<div class="row">
						<div class="col-lg-12 col-md-12 col-sm-12">
							<h2 class="big-title">2. about <strong>events</strong></h2>
						</div>
					</div>
				</div>

				<div class="faq-content-wrapper">
					<div class="row">

						<!-- left column -->
						<div class="col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12">
							<div id="faq-accordion3" class="faq-accordion">

								<div class="card">
									<div class="card-header" id="headingnine">
										<button class="btn collapsed" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#collapsenine" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapsenine">
											<span>01.</span> How do I browse available events?
										</button>
									</div>
									<div id="collapsenine" class="collapse" aria-labelledby="headingnine" data-parent="#faq-accordion3">
										<div class="card-body">
											Visit the Events page from the main navigation. You can view all published events sorted by date and location. Each listing shows the event name, category, city, date, and the number of workhand roles available.
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>

								<div class="card">
									<div class="card-header" id="headingten">
										<button class="btn" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#collapseten" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="collapseten">
											<span>02.</span> How do I apply for a workhand role at an event?
										</button>
									</div>
									<div id="collapseten" class="collapse show" aria-labelledby="headingten" data-parent="#faq-accordion3">
										<div class="card-body">
											Open any event's detail page and review the available roles and pay rates. If you meet the requirements, click Apply. Your profile will be sent to the company for review and you will be notified once a decision is made.
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>

								<div class="card">
									<div class="card-header" id="headingeleven">
										<button class="btn collapsed" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#collapseeleven" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapseeleven">
											<span>03.</span> Can I apply to more than one event at a time?
										</button>
									</div>
									<div id="collapseeleven" class="collapse" aria-labelledby="headingeleven" data-parent="#faq-accordion3">
										<div class="card-body">
											Yes. As a Workhand you can apply to multiple events simultaneously as long as the dates do not conflict. All your active applications and their statuses are visible in your History section.
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>

								<div class="card">
									<div class="card-header" id="headingtwelve">
										<button class="btn collapsed" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#collapsetwelve" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapsetwelve">
											<span>04.</span> How will I know if my application is accepted?
										</button>
									</div>
									<div id="collapsetwelve" class="collapse" aria-labelledby="headingtwelve" data-parent="#faq-accordion3">
										<div class="card-body">
											Once a company reviews your application, the status in your History section will update to Approved, Rejected, or Pending. You will be notified so you can check your status at any time.
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>

							</div>
						</div>
						<!-- left column end -->

						<!-- right column -->
						<div class="col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12">
							<div id="faq-accordion4" class="faq-accordion">

								<div class="card">
									<div class="card-header" id="headingthirteen">
										<button class="btn collapsed" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#collapsthirteen" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapsthirteen">
											<span>05.</span> How does a company post a new event?
										</button>
									</div>
									<div id="collapsthirteen" class="collapse" aria-labelledby="headingthirteen" data-parent="#faq-accordion4">
										<div class="card-body">
											Log in as a Company, navigate to My Events, and click Add Event. Provide the event name, category, date, location, and the number of workhands needed for each role. Once published, the event goes live and workhands can start applying.
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>

								<div class="card">
									<div class="card-header" id="headingfourteen">
										<button class="btn" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#collapsefourteen" aria-expanded="true" aria-controls="collapsefourteen">
											<span>06.</span> Can a company edit an event after publishing?
										</button>
									</div>
									<div id="collapsefourteen" class="collapse show" aria-labelledby="headingfourteen" data-parent="#faq-accordion4">
										<div class="card-body">
											Yes. Companies can edit event details such as the date, location, and description from the My Events dashboard at any time. Workhands who have already applied will be able to see the updated information.
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>

								<div class="card">
									<div class="card-header" id="headingfifteen">
										<button class="btn collapsed" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#collapsefifteen" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapsefifteen">
											<span>07.</span> How are workhand payments processed?
										</button>
									</div>
									<div id="collapsefifteen" class="collapse" aria-labelledby="headingfifteen" data-parent="#faq-accordion4">
										<div class="card-body">
											After an event concludes, the company processes payment through the Payments section of that event. The workhand's pay is calculated based on the agreed rate. Workhands can view payment status and history from their History section.
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>

								<div class="card">
									<div class="card-header" id="headingsixteen">
										<button class="btn collapsed" data-toggle="collapse" data-target="#collapsesixteen" aria-expanded="false" aria-controls="collapsesixteen">
											<span>08.</span> Is there a rating system for workhands or companies?
										</button>
									</div>
									<div id="collapsesixteen" class="collapse" aria-labelledby="headingsixteen" data-parent="#faq-accordion4">
										<div class="card-body">
											Yes. After an event is completed and payment is processed, companies can rate the workhands they worked with. Ratings are visible on workhand profiles and help companies make informed hiring decisions in the future.
										</div>
									</div>
								</div>

							</div>
						</div>
						<!-- right column end -->

					</div>
				</div>
				<!-- Section 2 end -->

			</div>
		</section>
		<!-- faq-section - end
		================================================== -->


